; Regression: the reader used to drop negative exponents entirely
; (reader.c abs_exp went negative so the apply-loop never ran), so 1e-10
; parsed as 1.0.  It also drifted from the correctly-rounded double.
; See docs/reader-float-parsing-plan.md.

; Negative exponents -- must keep their magnitude, not collapse to the mantissa
(println 1e-10)
(println 1.0e-10)
(println 2.5e-3)
(println 5e-1)
(println 1.25e-2)

; Positive exponents and plain decimals -- unchanged
(println 1.5e3)
(println 2e2)
(println 0.0001)
